<title>GERMANY: Buba revises German July industry orders up.</title>
<headline>Buba revises German July industry orders up.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS	Jul 96	   Jun 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.9 (+0.6)    +1.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +0.5 (-0.1)    +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    99.2 (98.9)    98.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +1.3 (+0.9)    +1.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -0.3 (-1.0)    +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    97.7 (97.3)    96.4</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -5.0  (-4.7)   +4.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		  +19.6 (+21.0)  +18.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   138.6 (139.1)  145.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
